        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatyosile kuwuleka mtembo wa ŵamkwawowo, ni ŵajawile kwadandawulila ŵandu ŵa mtundu wa Cihiti, kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Une ndili mlendo kumangwenu kuno, jwagamba kutama nawo mcilambo mwenu. Conde musumisye malo gakuti gaŵe malembe, kuti ngasice ŵamkwangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
